<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Speechify is the world's leading text-to-speech reading assistant, trusted by over 20 million users including students, professionals, and individuals with reading difficulties. What makes Speechify stand out is its focus on making reading accessible, efficient, and enjoyable through natural-sounding AI voices and intelligent features designed specifically for consuming written content.</p>
<p>Founded by Cliff Weitzman, who has dyslexia, Speechify was built to solve a real accessibility problem. Today, it's evolved into a comprehensive reading platform that helps anyone consume more content in less time. Whether you're a student tackling textbooks, a professional processing reports, or someone who simply prefers listening to reading, Speechify transforms any text into high-quality audio.</p>
<p>The platform works seamlessly across devices with apps for iOS, Android, Chrome, Safari, and Mac. You can scan physical documents with OCR, import PDFs and ebooks, or have web pages read aloud. With celebrity voice options, adjustable speeds up to 5x, and intelligent text highlighting, Speechify makes "reading with your ears" both productive and pleasant.</p>
